      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Ingestion & Multi-Tier Negative Subtraction",
      "items": [
        "Step 01 parallel-downloads 14,433 human unpaired B-cell repertoires from OAS",
        "Step 02 indexes >294M unique healthy CDR3 sequences into a high-compression Parquet cache",
        "Step 03 digests canonical UniProt and RefSeq proteomes (Trypsin with Proline rule: [KR](?!P)) into 2.88M tryptic peptides"
