      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Disease Database Engine & Delivery",
      "items": [
        "Step 04 subjects 6,344 disease files to Triple-Tier Negative Subtraction and micro-cassette assembly",
        "Quantifies clinical patient sharing (N >= 1) and read depth across 25 disease cohorts",
        "Stores 65.5M disease-exclusive clonotypes in 18 GB Hive-partitioned Apache Parquet (ZSTD L9)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Empirical Target-Decoy FDR & Interactive OLAP",
      "items": [
        "Step 05 extracts published Camelid VHH sequences with isobaric I -> L conversion for target-decoy benchmarking",
        "DBquery.R provides sub-second DuckDB OLAP queries, dynamic Alluvial flows, and exact reverse lookup",
